  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Employability of Host and Refugee Youth in Beirut and Mount Lebanon 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective: To enhance the economic self-sufficiency and livelihood opportunities for youth in Beirut and Mount Lebanon.

Specific Objectives:
&#xb7;	To facilitate access to the labor market through employability, and entrepreneurial skills for 140 youth, and to stimulate local economic growth through cash grants for the establishment or upgrade of businesses for 20 youth
&#xb7;	To empower young women by providing them with the necessary resources, skills, and knowledge through grants, life skills training, positive parenting education, protection awareness, and entrepreneurship training</narrative>
  </description>
